# Probe: Spark Double reanimated from its owner's graveyard by an opponent (Animate Dead) enters under the reanimator's
# control, so "a creature or planeswalker you control" is one the reanimator controls (CR 614.12, 110.2). Bot2's Spark
# Double dies as a 0/0 on turn 2; Bot2 then has an Ornithopter, Bot1 a Memnite. Animate Dead returns Spark Double for
# Bot1: the only legal copy is Bot1's Memnite.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Memnite
Animate Dead
Swamp
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Spark Double
Ornithopter
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Spark Double.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Animate Dead.Cast(Bot2.Graveyard.Spark Double)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Accept
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite#2.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter = (absent)
